<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN HAMON SHARES RISE 4.3 PCT ON BOURSE DEBUT.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN HAMON SHARES RISE 4.3 PCT ON BOURSE DEBUT.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Belgian cooling tower maker Hamon NV rose on their Brussels bourse debut on Monday, ending at 2,380 Belgian francs, 4.3 percent over their offer price.</p>
<p>Hamon sold 325,000 shares with low withholding tax strips in an initial public offering two weeks ago that was eleven times oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
